    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHA4BA637B7FE9AFD60AAFC364F915AE49" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Effective July 31, 2024, through a series of transactions Energy Transfer GC NGL Pipelines LP conveyed its 100% membership interest in Energy Transfer GC NGL Product Services LLC to Energy Transfer GC NGLs LLC, an indirect wholly owned subsidiary of Energy Transfer LP.<br /></p>
      </div>
